# 行尾规范
#
# 背景：项目在 Windows 上开发、部署到 Linux。若 shell 脚本被检出成 CRLF，
# 传到服务器会直接报 "bash: bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M"。
# 这里强制脚本类文件始终用 LF。

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理反而需要 CRLF
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不要做行尾/编码转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.doc binary
*.xls binary
*.onnx binary
*.om binary
*.db binary
*.so binary
*.pyd binary
*.dll binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
